    {
      "name": "D33",
      "label": "D33 (GPIO33)",
      "codeName": "D33",
      "capabilities": [],
      "notes": "Onboard microSD card chip-select (SPI1 SS). Confirmed via this board's own pins_arduino.h comments (\"// SD Card SPI\" bus header + \"// CS pin for SD card\" directly on PIN_SPI1_SS) - same dedicated-CS confirmation standard already used for sparkfun_thingplusrp2350's GPIO9 (also commented \"CS pin for SD card\", also excluded). This board's generic SS/MOSI/MISO/SCK aliases resolve to SPI0 (GPIO2-5), not SPI1, so GPIO33 carries no automatic bus-role tag - capabilities:[] fully excludes it from general I/O as intended."
    },
